PLR2044: deleting an empty comment after a line continuation left a dangling `\` at EOF
(or joined `\r` + `\n`); delete the continuation too.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-plr2044-continuation-at-eof.py (ruff_fix_validity).

